{"speciesId":7,"names":{"fr":"Carapuce","es":"Squirtle","en":"Squirtle","ja":"ゼニガメ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. Powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. Powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"The shell is soft when it is born. It soon becomes so resilient, prod­ ding fingers will bounce off it."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The shell, which hardens soon after it is born, is resilient. If you poke it, it will bounce back out."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it feels threatened, it draws its legs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SQUIRTLE’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this POKéMON to swim at high speeds."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SQUIRTLE’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this POKéMON to swim at high speeds."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its shell is not just for protection. Its rounded shape and the grooves on its surface minimize resistance in water, enabling SQUIRTLE to swim at high speeds."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When it retracts its long neck into its shell, it squirts out water with vigorous force."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. It powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The shell is soft when it is born. It soon becomes so resilient, prodding fingers will bounce off it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The shell, which hardens soon after it is born, is resilient. If you poke it, it will bounce back out."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se réfugie dans sa carapace et réplique en éclaboussant l’ennemi à la première occasion."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se réfugie dans sa carapace et réplique en éclaboussant l’ennemi à la première occasion."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se réfugie dans sa carapace et réplique en éclaboussant l’ennemi à la première occasion."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se protege con su caparazón y luego contraataca lanzando agua a presión cuando tiene oportunidad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"甲羅に 閉じこもり 身を 守る。 相手の すきを 見逃さず 水を 噴き出して 反撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Caché sous l’eau, il crache un jet d’eau sur sa proie et se cache à l’intérieur de sa carapace."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Lanza agua a su presa desde el agua. Se esconde en su concha cuando se siente en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"水面から 水を 噴射して エサを 取る。危なくなると 甲羅に 手足を ひっこめて 身を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La carapace de Carapuce ne sert pas qu’à le protéger. La forme ronde de sa carapace et ses rainures lui permettent d’améliorer son hydrodynamisme. Ce Pokémon nage extrêmement vite."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El caparazón de Squirtle no le sirve de protección únicamente. Su forma redondeada y las hendiduras que tiene le ayudan a deslizarse en el agua y le permiten nadar a gran velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Squirtle’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this Pokémon to swim at high speeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甲羅の 役目は 身を 守る だけではない。 丸い 形と 表面の 溝が 水の 抵抗を 減らすので 早く 泳げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La carapace de Carapuce ne sert pas qu’à le protéger. La forme ronde de sa carapace et ses rainures lui permettent d’améliorer son hydrodynamisme. Ce Pokémon nage extrêmement vite."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El caparazón de Squirtle no le sirve de protección únicamente. Su forma redondeada y las hendiduras que tiene le ayudan a deslizarse en el agua y le permiten nadar a gran velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Squirtle’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this Pokémon to swim at high speeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"甲羅の 役目は 身を 守る だけではない。 丸い 形と 表面の 溝が 水の 抵抗を 減らすので 早く 泳げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Caché sous les flots, il crache un jet d’eau sur sa proie et se réfugie à l’intérieur de sa carapace en cas de danger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Escupe chorros de agua mientras flota para capturar a sus presas. Se esconde en su caparazón cuando se siente en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"水面から 水を 噴射して エサをとる。危なくなると こうらに 手足を 引っこめて 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Caché sous les flots, il crache un jet d’eau sur sa proie et se réfugie à l’intérieur de sa carapace en cas de danger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Escupe chorros de agua mientras flota para capturar a sus presas. Se esconde en su caparazón cuando se siente en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"水面から 水を 噴射して エサをとる。危なくなると こうらに 手足を 引っこめて 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il rentre son cou dans sa carapace, il peut projeter de l’eau à haute pression."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando retrae su largo cuello en el caparazón, dispara agua a una presión increíble."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When it retracts its long neck into its shell, it squirts out water with vigorous force."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"長い 首を 甲羅のなかに 引っこめるとき 勢いよく 水鉄砲を 発射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"S’il se sent menacé, il rétracte ses pattes dans sa carapace pour se protéger et crache de l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando se siente en peligro, se esconde en su caparazón y escupe chorros de agua por la boca